This mythic creature gains:
- additional {g|Encyclopedia:HP}hit points{/g} equal to 2 * Challenge Rating * mythic level;
- a mythic {g|Encyclopedia:Bonus}bonus{/g} to {g|Encyclopedia:Attack}attack rolls{/g}, {g|Encyclopedia:Armor_Class}armor class{/g}, and {g|Encyclopedia:Skills}skills{/g} equal to its mythic level;
- a mythic bonus to {g|Encyclopedia:Saving_Throw}saving throws{/g}, {g|Encyclopedia:DC}DCs{/g} of {g|Encyclopedia:Spell}spells{/g}, and {g|Encyclopedia:Caster_Level}caster level{/g} equal to half its mythic level;
- an additional attack at full {g|Encyclopedia:BAB}BAB{/g};
- the power to use abilities and spells as a {g|Encyclopedia:Move_Action}move action{/g} instead of a {g|Encyclopedia:Standard_Actions}standard action{/g}.
